*.stackdump
crashlytics-build.properties
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# Addressables build output
/[Ss]erver[Dd]ata/
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# THIRD-PARTY STORE ASSETS — NEVER COMMIT
# Unity Asset Store / Fab content is licensed per-seat and must not be
# redistributed. Everything the team imports lands here and stays local.
# See docs/ASSETS.md for the manifest of what to import and from where.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/unity/Assets/ThirdParty/
/unity/Assets/Plugins/ThirdParty/

